From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ted Meyer <tmathmeyer@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 18:35:29 -0700
Subject: Remove the "safe url" from HLS

The origin blocking logic was re-implemented to use the post-redirection
uri instead of the manifest-declared uri, so this concept isn't needed
anymore.

Bug: 517550034
Bug: 517623783
Change-Id: If4e6f6b290db7bb2c0c2a70e7fea06e381f0ca65
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7947648
Reviewed-by: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Ted (Chromium) Meyer <tmathmeyer@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1648738}

